---
source: apps/via/tests/help_surface.rs
expression: "long_help(&[\"gateway\"])"
---
Run the Gateway in the foreground.

Resolves the configuration, refuses to start unconfigured, and takes the single-instance lease before anything else happens.

Usage: via gateway [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Gateway address (http or https; normalised to its origin)
          
          [env: VIA_URL]
          [default: http://127.0.0.1:3101]

      --backend <NAME>
          Backend agent id, or `none` for voice chat only
          
          [env: AGENT_PROTOCOL]

      --backend-permission-mode <MODE>
          native (default) or full (the Gateway's unified highest permission)
          
          [env: VIA_BACKEND_PERMISSION_MODE]

      --backend-url <URL>
          Address of an already-running backend server; passing it makes the backend external

      --backend-agent <ID>
          Coordinator agent id forwarded to the backend
          
          [env: VIA_BACKEND_AGENT]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
